# Build output
bin/
obj/
artifacts/
*.user
*.suo

# The client bundle is a BUILD OUTPUT (since 2026-09-01). The csproj builds it from Client/src when the
# manifest is missing (RaptorBuildClient defaults to true on a fresh clone) and CI/release always rebuild it
# with -p:RaptorBuildClient=true; RaptorClientBundleCheck still fails the build if no bundle exists, so an
# asset-free package cannot be produced by accident. Node 22 is a prerequisite for the first build.
wwwroot/dist/
Client/node_modules/
node_modules/

# Rspack/TS incidentals
*.tsbuildinfo
Client/dist/

# NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

# IDE
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.DotSettings.user

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
